<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="es" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.200"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">I need another kiss, one of those that you give me</text><text for="L2">Being far from you is hell, being close to you is my peace</text><text for="L3">I love it when you come, and hate it when you leave</text><text for="L4">I’ll follow you to the death</text><text for="L5">Don't leave me alone, where are you going? Where are you going?</text><text for="L6">Come here</text><text for="L7">Where are you going?</text><text for="L8">Oh, oh, when you dance with me, you give it all to me</text><text for="L9">Oh, oh, we're alone now, we take everything off</text><text for="L10">This pen can't contain all my feelings, hey</text><text for="L11">How shall I say it? You’re the infinite exponent, the X and the sum</text><text for="L12">The moon's too small for you</text><text for="L13">Although you're far away, you're the closest person to me</text><text for="L14">If my phone dies, I only tell you</text><text for="L15">If there was a past life, I drank from your water, I must have known you</text><text for="L16">The best thing I have is the love that you give me</text><text for="L17">It smells like tobacco and melon, and Sunday in the city</text><text for="L18">If you wait for me, I can bend time</text><text for="L19">I can tie up the sky and give it to you whole</text><text for="L20">I want another of your kisses, one of those you give me</text><text for="L21">Being far from you is hell, being with you is my peace</text><text for="L22">I love it when you come, and hate it when you leave</text><text for="L23">I’ll follow you to the death</text><text for="L24">Don't leave me alone, where are you going? Where are you going?</text><text for="L25">You smoke like you'll get thrown out for smoking</text><text for="L26">And you dance like a god would dance</text><text for="L27">And you kiss like you always knew how</text><text for="L28">And no one had to teach you</text><text for="L29">The best thing I have is the love that you give me</text><text for="L30">It smells like tobacco and melon, and Sunday in the city</text><text for="L31">If you wait for me, hey, I can bend time</text><text for="L32">I can tie up the sky and give it to you whole</text><text for="L33">I need another kiss</text><text for="L34">One of those that you give me</text><text for="L35">Being far from you is hell</text><text for="L36">Being with you is my peace</text><text for="L37">I love it when you come, and I hate it when you leave</text><text for="L38">I’ll follow you to the death</text><text for="L39">Don't leave me alone, where are you going? Where are you going?</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ROSALÍA</songwriter><songwriter>Raul Alejandro Ocasio</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
